  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to quality education for children in Honduras and El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve access to protective learning environments for girls, boy and adolescents affected by other situations of violence (OSV) in Honduras and El Salvador. The project will work at three levels: school, community and Secretary of Education/ Ministry of Education</narrative>
  </description>
